        {
          "text": " Kandi omugabe Asa yaabinga Maaka nyina, yaamwiha aha bwanyin'omugabe, naamutura okukorera Ashara ekishushani ekirikunugwa. Asa yaatema ekyo kishushani, yaakihondahonda, yaakyokyeza aha mugyera Kidirooni. ",
